  "body": "**Objective**: Implement and Support i2p in Matrix\r\n**Description**: Explore the possibility of using Matrix over i2p.\r\nWould non-i2p users be able to still communicate? Would you need to craft a bridge?\r\n**Why?**: Many reasons, mainly for privacy and security but also to support decentralized communications. \r\n\r\n________________________________\r\n\r\nWant to support this issue? Post a [bounty on it](https://www.bountysource.com/issues/75484734-feature-support-i2p)! We accept bounties via [BountySource](https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bountysource).\r\n\r\n[![Bountysource](https://api.bountysource.com/badge/issue?issue_id=75484734)](https://www.bountysource.com/issues/75484734-feature-support-i2p)",
